                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How is the Delhi + Gurugram jewelry market different from Mumbai?</h3>
                                        <p>Higher visible-luxury preference, strong Kundan + polki + meenakari heritage demand, distinct Punjabi wedding-jewelry segment (Rs 15L-2 Cr wedding-jewelry budgets), Hindi + Punjabi + English multilingual creative needs, hub for NRI wedding + gifting. Startup D2C ecosystem in Gurugram + Noida. Wedding season Nov-Feb + Karwa Chauth + Diwali + Dhanteras peaks.</p>
                                        <h3>Do Gurugram D2C jewelry startups need a different agency than Delhi traditional brands?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes different capabilities. Startup D2C needs VC-attribution reporting + rapid iteration + Meta + Google velocity + headless Shopify. Delhi traditional-hybrid needs bridal + wedding calendar planning + Hindi + Punjabi creative + NRI-diaspora funnel + retail + omnichannel expertise. Same agency can serve both if capabilities span.</p>
                                        <h3>How much does jewelry marketing cost in Delhi + Gurugram?</h3>
                                        <p>Same tiered pricing as pan-India: Rs 65K-Rs 1.5 lakh / month Starter, Rs 1.5-3.5 lakh Growth, Rs 4 lakh+ Enterprise. Gurugram + Noida talent + real estate costs may add 5-15% to remote-agency-equivalent pricing. Ad spend separate.</p>
                                        <h3>What languages should Delhi jewelry marketing creative be produced in?</h3>
                                        <p>English + Hindi + Punjabi. Hindi + Punjabi creative reaches culturally-aligned wedding + festive buyers. Multilingual outperforms English-only by 25-40% on local + regional catchment cost + engagement.</p>
                                        <h3>Is NRI + international-diaspora targeting important for Delhi jewelry brands?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes. Delhi is India's largest hub for NRI wedding + gifting jewelry buyers. Cross-border shipping + certification (BIS + IGI + Kimberley) + duty handling for USA + UK + GCC + Canada + Australia matters. Requires agency familiarity with cross-border logistics + international-diaspora Meta + Google targeting.</p>
                                        <h3>Which Delhi + Gurugram jewelry brands has ITD worked with?</h3>
                                        <p>Client references available under NDA on discovery call. Jewelry vertical work includes Fabelia case study + 8+ published playbooks. City-specific jewelry marketing published for Mumbai + GCC (Dubai + Abu Dhabi + Jeddah + Doha + Dammam + Al Khobar) + India-wide.</p>
                                        <h3>Do you support Karol Bagh + Chandni Chowk traditional brands going digital?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes. Traditional-to-digital transformation is a distinct engagement type. Brand modernisation + Shopify + Instagram + WhatsApp funnel + next-gen buyer capture + bridge to Karol Bagh + Chandni Chowk existing retail. See our <a href="/resources/india_jewelry_d2c_vs_traditional_retail.php">traditional-vs-D2C playbook</a>.</p>
                                        <h3>How does the discovery + engagement work with ITD for Delhi brands?</h3>
                                        <p>30-min Calendly discovery. Scoped proposal within 3 business days. 6-month MSA with month-to-month cancellation after month 3 if milestones missed. Ad spend transparent pass-through billing. Founder-founder access on strategic engagements. Monthly + quarterly in-person visits to Delhi + Gurugram feasible.</p>
